      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Local gunsmith Medad Hills crafted firearms used in the French and Indian War and the Revolutionary War, giving Goshen an early role in American history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
